{
  "path": "/detail/workflow",
  "title": "워크플로우",
  "desc": "업무를 자동화하는 흐름을 만들고 배포하고 관찰하는 곳",
  "toc": [],
  "html": "<p>워크플로우는 <strong>블록을 이어 붙여 만든 자동화 흐름</strong>입니다.\n빌더에서 만들고, 배포해서 밖에서 부를 수 있게 하고, 로그로 실행 결과를 확인하는 순서로 씁니다.</p>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 @container\"><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/enter-builder\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">워크플로우 빌더 진입하기</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>빌더를 여는 경로와 화면 구성</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/builder\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">워크플로우 빌더</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>워크플로우 만들기·복제, 코파일럿 활용</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/blocks\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">워크플로우 블록 가이드</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>블록별 사용법</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/dashboard\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">Dashboard</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>실행 통계, 배포 상태, 모델 사용량, 멤버와 최근 활동</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/logs\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">Logs</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>실행 로그 읽기, 오류 원인 파악, 배포 후 점검</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/knowledge-base\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">Knowledge Base</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>지식베이스 만들기, 문서 업로드, 워크플로우에서 쓰기</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/versions\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">Versions</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>버전 이력과 스냅샷, 복원과 삭제</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/deploy-status\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">Deploy Status</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>배포 상태 이해하기, 배포·재배포·배포 해제, 엔드포인트 설정</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/tables\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">Tables</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>워크플로우가 쓸 구조화 데이터 만들기와 관리</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/templates\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">Templates</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>템플릿 둘러보기와 사용하기, 내 워크플로우를 템플릿으로 배포하기</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/template-approval\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">템플릿 배포 요청 승인하기</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>대기 중인 템플릿 검토, 승인과 거절</p></div></a><a data-card=\"true\" class=\"block rounded-xl border bg-fd-card p-4 text-fd-card-foreground transition-colors @max-lg:col-span-full hover:bg-fd-accent/80\" href=\"#/detail/workflow/settings\"><h3 class=\"not-prose mb-1 text-sm font-medium\">Settings</h3><div class=\"text-sm text-fd-muted-foreground prose-no-margin empty:hidden\"><p>계정과 일반 설정, 도구 연결, 환경변수와 API 키</p></div></a></div>"
}